  "details": "1. Go to Inventory -> Photo Gallery section.\n\n2. Click the thumbnail of one of your Uploaded Photos.\n\n3. Observe that it becomes your profile picture.\n\nExpected result:\n\nThe photo should become your profile picture only after explicitly clicking the \"wear\" button.\n\nI clicked the thumbnail expecting to see the full resolution version, but nothing happened, so I just closed the page. Later I noticed that the photo had been set as my profile picture, even though I never clicked the \"wear\" button. I didn't notice this immediately because the page was scrolled down and my current profile picture was outside the visible area.",
